// Test: brute-force-then-success
// Rule: Repeated failed passwords then a successful sign-in from the same IP (detections/brute-force-then-success.yaml)
// Twelve failures then a success from one IP fires; failures without a success and a few failures then success don't.
// Generated by tools/build_tests.py from tests/cases/brute-force-then-success.yaml. Do not edit by hand.
